WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Ryu begins the recorded Drive Impact.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:02.950
Kimberly answers with her own Drive Impact.

3
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.150
The counter Drive Impact crumples Ryu.

4
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.050
Crouching heavy punch starts the follow-up juggle.

5
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.900
Heavy Edge leads into the OD air grab.

6
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.900
Sprint launcher picks up the rebound.

7
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.450
Light Vagabond Edge finishes the juggle.

8
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:09.850
Ryu falls after the complete conversion.
